#: R/texts.R
msgid ""
"Only %d subjects. Between-rater coefficients describe how items order the "
"subjects, so their precision depends mainly on the number of subjects, not "
"of raters; with this few, read HB and BW as very imprecise and confirm that "
"the subject variable is really the rated person or object."
msgstr ""
"Solo %d sujetos. Los coeficientes entre evaluadores describen cómo los ítems "
"ordenan a los sujetos, así que su precisión depende sobre todo del número de "
"sujetos, no de evaluadores; con tan pocos, lea HB y BW como muy imprecisos y "
"confirme que la variable de sujeto es realmente la persona u objeto evaluado."

